{"n":1,"text":"The Resonators gathered at the edge of Jinzhou before dawn.","fonts":["Segoe UI","Arial","Tahoma","Times New Roman","Cambria","Palatino Linotype","Consolas","Courier New"]}
{"n":2,"text":"I can hear an echo of something old beneath the city.","fonts":["Segoe UI","Arial","Tahoma","Times New Roman","Cambria","Palatino Linotype","Consolas","Courier New"]}
{"n":3,"text":"Let\u0027s go together.","fonts":["Segoe UI","Arial","Tahoma","Times New Roman","Cambria","Palatino Linotype","Consolas","Courier New"]}
{"n":4,"text":"I\u0027ll go alone.","fonts":["Segoe UI","Arial","Tahoma","Times New Roman","Cambria","Palatino Linotype","Consolas","Courier New"]}
{"n":5,"text":"Tell me more about the Tacet Discord.","fonts":["Segoe UI","Arial","Tahoma","Times New Roman","Cambria","Palatino Linotype","Consolas","Courier New"]}
{"n":6,"text":"Then we leave now. Stay close to me.","fonts":["Segoe UI","Arial","Tahoma","Times New Roman","Cambria","Palatino Linotype","Consolas","Courier New"]}
